Z||000001||88formula||05-20-2001||07:19 PM||||The factory manual I have lists them in metric diameter as 43.688 intake and 38.1 exhaust. That’s approximately 1.72 intake and 1.5 exhaust.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||danny boy||05-20-2001||07:46 PM||||that is right. I had a machine shop use SBC valves in my 87 coupe head. they left the 1.5 exausts and used 1.94 intakes with shortened stems. Scrapped the project before it was finished, though.||||reg||1
